            "description": "A scoped site build: the comma-separated instances whose pages this writer writes (the IG and the layer it lands on); every other instance's pages are linked on that layer's own site. Passed by the tools layer's `visualiser-writers.ts` (owner, 2026-11-08, Q-SZ-2 \"B\"). Absent: every instance.",
            "name": "scope",
            "required": false,
